# Myrvento Loyalty for WooCommerce

WordPress + WooCommerce plugin (HPOS). PHP 7.4+, text domain `myrvento-loyalty-for-woocommerce`, capability `manage_woocommerce`. Display name: Myrvento Loyalty for WooCommerce. Slug: `myrvento-loyalty-for-woocommerce`.

## Names

- Classes `Ciwp_*`, files `includes/**/class-*.php`
- Functions, hooks, options, cron, asset handles: `ciwp_*`
- Tables `wp_gp_*` via `Ciwp::table()` — never hardcode `$wpdb->prefix`
- REST namespace `ciwp/v1`; WP error codes `gp_*`
- CSS/JS prefix `ciwp-` (Tailwind `prefix: "ciwp-"`, preflight off). Brand teal (`brand-500` `#14b8a6`)
- Admin mount `#ciwp-admin-root` with `data-page`; body class `ciwp-admin-page`

```php
// ❌ BAD
$wpdb->query( "SELECT * FROM {$wpdb->prefix}gp_points_ledger WHERE customer_id = $id" );

// ✅ GOOD
$wpdb->get_results(
	$wpdb->prepare(
		'SELECT * FROM ' . Ciwp::table( 'points_ledger' ) . ' WHERE customer_id = %d',
		$id
	)
);
```

## PHP

- `defined( 'ABSPATH' ) || exit;` and `@package Ciwp` on every file
- WordPress style: tabs, Yoda, `array()`, sanitise/escape, i18n every string
- All `$wpdb` reads/writes with variables must use `$wpdb->prepare()`. Identifiers (table via `Ciwp::table()`, columns) stay outside placeholders; values use `%d`, `%f`, `%s`. Never interpolate user or request data into SQL. Static SQL with no variables may skip `prepare()`
- Paid orders: `wc_get_is_paid_statuses()` with `wc-` prefix. Prefer WC lookup tables (`wc_order_stats`, `wc_order_product_lookup`, `wc_customer_lookup`). `wc_order_coupon_lookup` has no `customer_id` — join stats
- Schema changes bump `CIWP_DB_VERSION` and `Ciwp_Installer::create_tables()`
- Optional narration uses the WordPress AI Client. Do not store a provider API key or call a provider URL. Referral codes and visitor fingerprints use `Ciwp::hash_secret()`, never WordPress authentication salts

## Admin (React 18)

- One WP submenu per feature; inner tabs stay in React
- Pages in `admin/src/pages/`, API in `admin/src/api.js` (`window.ciwpAdmin`)
- After JSX/CSS changes run the webpack admin build; empty store must show empty states, not errors
- Browser-verify admin UI; WP login submit is `#loginform` (`<input>`), not a button

## Domain

- Unified points ledger is the only writer of customer balances. Referrals credit that ledger — no separate wallet, no affiliate payouts
- AI models run on-store. Optional narration only rewrites Myrvento Brain cards through the WordPress AI Client. Prices are never auto-applied
- Do not insert stray tokens (` mar`) into PHP/JSX
- Do not edit plan files unless asked
